        "hadith-eng":"\"The Prophet (ﷺ) put a garment over Al-Hasan, Al-Hussain, 'Ali and Fatimah, then he said: 'O Allah, these are the people of my house and the close ones, so remove the Rijs from them and purify them thoroughly.\" So Umm Salamah said: 'And am I with them, O Messenger of Allah?' He said: \"You are upon good.\"'",
