    {
        "hadith-eng":"\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) stoned, Abu Bakr stoned, and I stoned. If I didn't dislike that I add to the Book of Allah. I would have written it in the Mushaf, for I fear that there will come a people and they will not find it in the Book of Allah, so they will disbelieve in it.\"",
        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 1431, Book 17, Hadith 11",
        "grade":"Sahih(Darussalam)",
