        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 1538, Book 20, Hadith 17",
        "grade":"Sahih(Darussalam)",
        "question #":"question #2",
        "question":"How does making vows relate to a person's financial behavior according to Islamic teachings?"
    },
    {
