        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 1539, Book 20, Hadith 18",
        "grade":"Sahih(Darussalam)",
        "question #":"question #2",
        "question":"How does Islam view vows made during the pre-Islamic period of ignorance?"
    },
    {
