    },
    {
        "hadith-eng":"from the Prophet (ﷺ), regarding this Ayah \"Say: He has the power to send torment on you from above or from under your feet...' the Prophet (ﷺ) said \"Indeed they shall be, even though they have not occurred as of yet.\"",
        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 3066, Book 47, Hadith 118",
        "grade":"Da'if(Darussalam)",
