        "hadith-eng":"And his progeny, them We made survivors (37:77).' The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Ham, Sam and Yafith\" - with (the letter) Tha.",
        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 3230, Book 47, Hadith 282",
