    },
    {
        "hadith-eng":"\"I said to Abu Hurairah: 'Why were you given the Kunyah Abu Hurairah?' He said: 'Do you not fear me?'\" He said: \"Indeed, I am in awe of you.' He said: 'I used to tend the sheep of my people, and I had a small kitten; so I used to place it in a tree at night, and during the day I would take it with me and play with it. So they named me Abu Hurairah.'\"",
        "reference":"Jami` at-Tirmidhi 3840, Book 49, Hadith 240",
