    {
        "hadith-eng":"that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) was at Hira, him, Abu Bakr, 'Umar, 'Uthman, 'Ali, Talhah and Az-Zubair (may Allah be pleased with them all), and the boulder (mount Hira) shook. So the Prophet (ﷺ) said: \"Be calm, for there is none upon you except a Prophet, or a Siddiq, or a martyr.\"",
