    {
        "hadith-eng":"that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), Abu Bakr, 'Umar, and 'Uthman climbed Uhud (mountain) and it shook them, so the Prophet of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Be firm O Uhud! For there is none upon you except a Prophet, a Siddiq, and two martyrs.\"",
